        <activityName xml:lang="en">Acrylonitrile from Sohio process, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Acrylonitrile from Sohio process, at plant
The multioutput-process "Sohio process" delivers the co-products acrylonitrile, hydrigen cyanide, and acetoinitrile. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: 3d976da0-0b98-3eaf-b39d-0297fbe70066
Sohio process including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Sohio process
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3d976da0-0b98-3eaf-b39d-0297fbe70066.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
